0..68 Comment "//! A Tarski universe closed under pairs, dependent pairs and paths."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..152 Comment "//! Martin-Löf\'s universe is closed under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
153..229 Comment "//! and identity types. Each such code decodes to a family at the decodes of"
230..307 Comment "//! its fields. A decode thus stands as a family\'s argument, a call in place."
308..344 Comment "//! The call is the type it returns."
345..348 Comment "//!"
349..426 Comment "//! Each code is its own block. The pair code decodes to the pairs of its two"
427..499 Comment "//! decodes. The dependent pair code decodes to the pairs over its first"
500..571 Comment "//! decode. Its second field is a family of codes over that decode. The"
572..649 Comment "//! decoder\'s binder takes the same decode, so the two convert. The path code"
650..718 Comment "//! decodes to the paths between two values of its carrier\'s decode."
719..722 Comment "//!"
723..801 Comment "//! - see: `pathological/universe/pair-and-path-codes.gandr` — a run for the"
802..829 Comment "//!   first decode, refused"
830..901 Comment "//! - see: `model/universe/inductive-recursive.gandr` — the dependent"
902..927 Comment "//!   functions, admitted"
928..984 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
985..988 Comment "//!"
989..1161 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
